{
 "translate": "<div class=\"rows\">\n      <div class=\"row\" data-code=\"12110131211001302312110031210101130231211113212113123121010113021000003302100000030231212110013121001011331231210101132233\" data-fold=\"1\"></div>\n      <div class=\"row\" data-code=\"1211302100000302100000032233\"></div>\n      <div class=\"more-note\">…then it speaks the decree backward, and unmakes it…</div>\n      <div class=\"row\" data-code=\"1210130231211302100000302100000032233\"></div>\n    </div>",
 "rows": "<div class=\"rows\">\n      <div class=\"row\" data-code=\"12100103121000032233\"></div>\n    </div>",
 "rows-2": "<div class=\"rows\">\n      <div class=\"row\" data-code=\"12100010132121000030213021030211330232121111103021133021302103021132233\" data-fold=\"1\"></div>\n    </div>",
 "find": "<div class=\"rows\">\n      <div class=\"row\" data-code=\"121132121211111031210011003322121111103021003302100013021003021130203302033021132233\"></div>\n      <div class=\"row\" data-code=\"1211321212111110312100110033221211111030210033021001130211030211113021000033021011331231210000032233\"></div>\n    </div>",
 "find-readback": "<div class=\"readback\">\n      <div class=\"rb-label\">read back</div>\n      <div class=\"row\" data-code=\"121132121211111031210011003322121111103021003302100013021003021130203302033021132233\"></div>\n      <div class=\"row\" data-code=\"1211321212111110312100110033221211111030210033021001130211030211113021000033021011331231210000032233\"></div>\n      <div class=\"rb-note\">One hunt that lands and one that doesn't, and the failing one gives back Bram's mark: <span class=\"gl sg\" data-s=\"list:find\"></span>, then <span class=\"gl sg\" data-s=\"undefined\"></span>.</div>\n    </div>",
 "frac": "<div class=\"rows\">\n      <div class=\"row\" data-code=\"121130213023121010321210011130213021033212100111302130210332233\"></div>\n    </div>",
 "within-epsilon": "<div class=\"rows\">\n      <div class=\"row\" data-code=\"1210101103123121210010031210101113312312101001312312121010013121011100332233\"></div>\n    </div>",
 "within-epsilon-readback": "<div class=\"readback\">\n      <div class=\"rb-label\">read back</div>\n      <div class=\"row\" data-code=\"1210101103123121210010031210101113312312101001312312121010013121011100332233\"></div>\n      <div class=\"rb-note\">It never closes the gap — only stands nearer, and will not pretend otherwise: <span class=\"gl sg\" data-s=\"within\"></span>.</div>\n    </div>",
 "pow": "<div class=\"rows\">\n      <div class=\"row\" data-code=\"121001031210000132233\"></div>\n      <div class=\"row\" data-code=\"1211302100003023121000013021030210032233\"></div>\n    </div>",
 "float-decimal": "<div class=\"rows\">\n      <div class=\"row\" data-code=\"1212101101131211332121011010302103023121000030211302111302100030210030213302312100001302103212101101030213023121000030210302101332233\" data-fold=\"1\"></div>\n    </div>",
 "float-pow": "<div class=\"rows\">\n      <div class=\"row\" data-code=\"121210110113121133021000302312100001302103021132233\"></div>\n    </div>",
 "exp": "<div class=\"rows\">\n      <div class=\"row\" data-code=\"1210010312101111132233\"></div>\n      <div class=\"row\" data-code=\"121101312121011111312101110033023121100312101011302312100101031231210103023121001001321211003121111113023121001113212121000013121100013312312101011312312111111330231212100131210331231211111133023121011000302030211001032233\" data-fold=\"1\"></div>\n    </div>",
 "float-exp": "<div class=\"rows\">\n      <div class=\"row\" data-code=\"1212101101131211331231210100030231212101111131210111003302132233\"></div>\n    </div>",
 "copied": "<div class=\"copied\">\n      <div class=\"cp-label\">copied, not read</div>\n      <div class=\"cp-item\">Some eighty more provings of raising, whole counts and figures both, and a second raising-mark for tens alone. All true where I checked them. I checked eleven.</div>\n      <div class=\"cp-item\">A row-maker that lays out the counts from one bound to another; a mark for the distance of a count from none, and marks for the halving-kind of a count, even or odd. Set down whole. I had no use for them tonight and they cost me nothing to keep.</div>\n      <div class=\"cp-item\">Three more workings of that same maker, given not the one but a long figure I do not know, and coming out at ten heaped upon itself twice, three times, four. It gives the long figure bare. It does not build it and it does not name it. I have the figures and not the sense of them, and I am setting that down for whoever comes: that one is not finished.</div>\n    </div>",
 "minus-i": "<div class=\"rows\">\n      <div class=\"row\" data-code=\"12113212101010030213302312100131231210101031231210101032233\"></div>\n    </div>",
 "float-exp-2": "<div class=\"rows\"><div class=\"row\" data-code=\"1212101101131211330203023121010302130231212101111131210111003302312100131231210100131231210101032233\" data-fold=\"1\"></div></div>",
 "walls": "<div class=\"rows labeled\">\n      <div class=\"row hand\" data-hand=\"notation\" data-of=\"12100010132121000030213021030211330232121111103021133021302103021132233\"><span class=\"lbl\">as it comes</span><span class=\"fig\"><span class=\"cup o\">⟅</span><span class=\"gl sg\" data-s=\"vector\"></span> <span class=\"num barred\" data-n=\"1\"></span> <span class=\"num barred\" data-n=\"2\"></span> <span class=\"num barred\" data-n=\"3\"></span><span class=\"cup c\">⟆</span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row hand\" data-hand=\"notation\" data-of=\"12100010132121000030213021030211330232121111103021133021302103021132233\"><span class=\"lbl\">as I write it</span><span class=\"fig\"><span class=\"cup lo\">⟦</span><span class=\"num barred\" data-n=\"1\"></span> <span class=\"num barred\" data-n=\"2\"></span> <span class=\"num barred\" data-n=\"3\"></span><span class=\"cup lc\">⟧</span></span></div>\n    </div>",
 "pow-readback": "<div class=\"readback\">\n      <div class=\"rb-label\">read back</div>\n      <div class=\"row\" data-code=\"1211302100003023121000013021030210032233\"></div>\n      <div class=\"rb-note\">A count laid on itself so many times: <span class=\"gl w\" data-sign=\"pow\">raising</span>.</div>\n    </div>"
}
